<title>TURKEY: BP wins Tupras 50-60,000 t LS fuel-oil tender.</title>
<headline>BP wins Tupras 50-60,000 t LS fuel-oil tender.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's state oil refinery company Tupras said British Petroleum has won a tender to sell Tupras 50,000 to 60,000 tonnes of low-sulphur fuel-oil at a premium of $10.27 per tonne.</p>
<p>The deliveries will be made at Izmit and Izmir ports between March 25 and April 5, it said.</p>
<p>Tupras held the tender on February 26.</p>
<p>--Ankara Newsroom, 90-312-4462940</p>
